{"timestamp": "2026-01-14 23:16:06", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-fc6e2224-fa1e-4f7f-9d20-ff9f27adc064', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "task_description": "Write comprehensive unit tests for text contrast compliance in the SelfImprovementDashboard component. Focus on WCAG 2.1 AA compliance checks (4.5:1 contrast ratio) for both normal mode and \'Bumpers Off\' danger mode. Test proper text color adaptations to ensure readability against dark backgrounds while preserving functionality and design intent. Include tests for status cards, badges, buttons, alerts, and modal text visibility in both modes.",\n  "test_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/__tests__/SelfImprovementDashboard.test.jsx",\n  "code_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/SelfImprovementDashboard.jsx",\n  "testing_framework": "jest",\n  "mock_dependencies": {\n    "react-bootstrap": "Mock all Bootstrap components",\n    "../services/api": "Mock all API service calls",\n    "import.meta.env": "Mock environment variables"\n  },\n  "test_scenarios": [\n    "Text contrast in normal mode - ensure all text has sufficient contrast ratio",\n    "Text contrast in \'Bumpers Off\' mode - verify danger mode styling maintains readability",\n    "Status cards text visibility - test white text on colored backgrounds",\n    "Badge text contrast - verify readability of priority and type badges",\n    "Button text contrast - check all button variants for proper contrast",\n    "Alert text contrast - test both normal and danger alert readability",\n    "Modal text contrast - ver