', 'input': {'agent_type': 'testers/unit_test_writer', 'input_data': {'task_description': "Create comprehensive unit tests for text contrast compliance in the SelfImprovementDashboard React component. The tests must verify WCAG 2.1 AA compliance (4.5:1 contrast ratio) for both normal mode and 'Bumpers Off' danger mode. Key test scenarios: 1) Normal mode - verify text colors have sufficient contrast on light backgrounds, 2) Bumpers Off mode - ensure danger-colored backgrounds still have readable text, 3) Status cards with different bg variants (success, danger, warning, info, secondary, primary, dark) have appropriate text colors, 4) Badge components maintain proper contrast ratios, 5) Alert components in both modes have readable text, 6) Modal components have proper text contrast, 7) Table text remains readable in all scenarios. Create the test file from scratch with proper Jest/React Testing Library setup, mocking React Bootstrap components, and implementing contrast ratio calculations to verify WCAG compliance programmatically.", 'test_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/__tests__/SelfImprovementDashboard.test.jsx', 'code_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/SelfImprovementDashboard.jsx', 'create_file_if_missing': True}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01J7rgwxfvzvkd89XMr3Qk2q', 'content': '{"success": true, "result": {}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_019tC4tLwGE9JzStL6VW9ucM', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/__tests__/SelfImprovementDashboard.test.jsx'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_019tC4tLwGE9JzStL6VW9ucM', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "File not found: /Users/